{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1560,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ef96869fccda640872ed384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小金花给我做了能在LANE上使用的\n小花花贴图！实在太可爱了。\n让人想不停的戳戳戳呢～♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "676eb2ba8c21801e2c3198b89ed6693d264304fede23c806d3938bf63972f40b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d366c35ca1b3abc1176221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候的我可是个疯丫头呢。\n每张照片都是满身的泥……呵呵。\n要不然休息时回归一下童心吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "613e479f6705c209652277b7a4aade3892899cb4cfc54a8f22d75489a91a1af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3bb8f33bbddc6d5fa1a1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次直播后，爸爸妈妈都会告诉我\n感想。即使分开也不会寂寞……\n因为有爱将我们相连♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3cdad92aa966cc5225c446fc1029cb3e773748327ba56140bce68bc9df31d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f23e797fe9f28bcef2e83e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live结束后很期待看到\n粉丝们的留言。\n大家的喜悦就是我的能量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c909bb42380d9590f55cf025ab31e70aa88d22af2da1832760720c1173ac3e72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7560a9917d1ae44a5ca50b27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备……爱心射线♡\n这个姿势最重要的是视线。\n就算是画面的另一侧也会被击穿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd76f2f46003df41513a6f794eb3397bdf0f79b6fc384ded4e9d78574c9f5d5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5561c609c7f5d9af4b9e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服社区民也一起参与了设计。\n背负着大家的爱，\n毫无疑问要拿下第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc656be693c7bd35f880ac32b091f1db963f9cbd6152d9009ed4fc3a1475e88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385bfdbd86f61feec0fa0756",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身上有多少颗爱心呢？\n……正确答案是衣服上有26个，\n再加上心里的一大堆♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "c745682fdde4799d432c04103bfe3194aba78055b90a51c0627ac002bd12ecf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ee316d16d2ec064394b74b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，从早上开始就很精神呢。\n为了不造成负担，\n看来昨晚的早下播是正确选择♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ba3dc29e8bceb13a695f4eb0e206748c76e7dad0074941535b8d60dc55d6cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e97066cb1c6394f54e961e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭以沙拉为主之后，\n状态就变得很好了。\n小欢呼的优点，我会多多学习的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf24fc161ecf52e3fdcec527025676f7cb09293407a5edd1d8f210cfb4cd443",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0d6c625bfc4482db976c0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给沉迷于读书的小创吹头发\n是我的日常。托她的福，\n吹风机也用得更熟练了，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "020e4ae6682cd8d69c8867c357647497aebe0034cd49a2de5da7d0eabfc7e600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c16dbc97624d43a4d73c0e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候和青梅竹马发现的赏花场所\n是只属于两个人的秘密。\n也是只属于我们的爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd60f24f3d41bfe38a44741c05271ee31dd33e5c525495f7ea695f2b110d1a48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ed4df2a86b7ca15a1e8bc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去吃树莓冰淇淋吧！\n就是直播时说过的那家店。\n是酸酸甜甜的爱呢～♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02e0af0297211710d989ed5ba4a07423c7f422f1d6b696273165ab81853cb13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2947b34977c9b920cc9afb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "品尝秋之味觉的巡礼真是享受啊！\n但为了不影响比赛，\n必须得严格自律才行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14448bc408aaca3ccbc591fdfdbfd0d229137cba4e72d9fc50e4afe7668b85b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8733479dad3624a378fd547d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，今天可是长时间直播哦！\n中途睡倒也OK，我和观众都会\n捧着热可可开启暖呼呼的杂谈时光♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e21a683996e833a8f216a3efd423355d158c3048fe093bcdae8d027bd2caa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aebd38117fa93aa06626bcb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要直播一下训练吗？\n我的努力要是能成为大家的活力\n那就太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d377c02caed2354b1414ab8f559f29c0a742a9e5185227059c4f669a8dbd9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:093e5c29bef6c206e84a488e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有温柔的话不能算爱。\n要不断地获胜……在和大家分享爱\n的那天到来之前，不需要客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f216c23c3cb240ebd4b9aa17ccaf2be9cb1b2285f6b0f8d39e1177b9d7aa1a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a84099159aec715069c394f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就用我的相机来拍摄造型吧。\n就用我引以为傲的美丽影像，\n来彻底剖析课题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca50af96ae473ce3541fd53a7b47624b7720affa8ec5ff199a2c36b42e14696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87105fe39015390183cb5e05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来很累呢……对了！\n要不你也来做一下伸展运动吧？\n一起的话，精神也会倍增哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d652c070824da6f91eec73f9e86b59b55406a6f7aee7895bcb5159beff7eee62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728ed6e7864148dc430bfefe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的爱是必要的。\n为了更多地把爱扩散出去，\n助我一臂之力吧，训练员君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db988fe8ed813438131923d8d60c06690e8fb0b05d045a0d2530ab5b927db67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f349a6c879803763589bfa91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学到的东西会将结果联系起来。\n那就是用我的爱来回报你的爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c710e9654bd12193c41b956938ddbf999e6fe63bce277426d0bbd25955c128b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad2dac0d8a9eb7bf682e9a00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，两人相连的爱之轮\n包围世界的瞬间，我都等不及了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff3bee9e819f6c8425b819951a1c924a89649a626f1684d2a3df7bd97ff02b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:251eba6d9144e455d4366646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐！说是集训所里\n摄影和直播都OK呢 ！\n……等会儿一起来试试吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ac85e06d15e35c41a70b0734d0c4a63fc4c3101f7f1bc7d1028affeff95ada1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8a47745336855899ffb085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来很累呢……对了！\n要不你也来做一下伸展运动吧？\n一起的话，精神也会倍增哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d652c070824da6f91eec73f9e86b59b55406a6f7aee7895bcb5159beff7eee62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0fba6d31dabf3e2f77c868b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的爱是必要的。\n为了更多地把爱扩散出去，\n助我一臂之力吧，训练员酱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c089a7cd81593d6aee1c7a0def69aa9cee752482320c4efd7bff9ebdab23b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3dfdc442c2577853b8bd72e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学到的东西会将结果联系起来。\n那就是用我的爱来回报你的爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c710e9654bd12193c41b956938ddbf999e6fe63bce277426d0bbd25955c128b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8aba0c6ba673ff9959c0d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱与被爱。真的很幸福呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ba5604983f2a95808959e36fcac2b33741fefbcabd844e8c6178fd2fecd7ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d97d364652f6962889401de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为大家的Love，我变强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb34b1c29498ed33913e7c59e206e19be684a650fee605834c19f6a6edd96a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4429720f6d0643a1e9aa3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "增加频道订阅人数，需要你的Love哦。\n宣传就麻烦你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81f086ff19ae4530f08fc2ec71f4a5908ef3988f4d5839fb35358a32138b646b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167f8846452bd055c4d0ee90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标达成谢谢协作！\n收下这份作为礼物的爱吧♪\n之后也一起热闹向前吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fc246887adfb0dc477103bb6e2ecd19de901a667baa7b4a435739829c30489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c3544dd6da71f45c73d3fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，nice love！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cebf077a4dc07d115f80e36c735747b3d04444b57084ed7c00c72142b2d5786d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9559e7250a5968a55cc146b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就更能传达爱了呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3a17aea9a9eada0a0d6b5e52a3889890d3ff50269831a51d0cbdc97e1d8a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58e6d8f1e9413b6268eef0ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love me♡  Love you♡\n我是唯独爱你♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "47029025839e81167e0b9a6e3b1ab82071bafed4d9a4f30890eb034e75d3aeb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0a2172db35bbfd404cbdba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起去填满吧！\n用无限的爱，覆盖整个世界♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "3428ac3c9ee1ffcdab65e6f241750581fab13fc0741ddc61e01933fa9a513b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c51c869d92eabe875b505e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要把它变成名留历史之战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2a9580ebc048ff4c7ae27e0db9f521764d04a14076f9fc32da744bc3903333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e197b5776939cba10417c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命运般的邂逅……虽然在赛跑史上\n是惯用表达……但对我来说，\n是特指与训练员的相遇呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fda06b919b3b22ae52aea3b94844de92cadab2aae95e5b192db9a48e5db6d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5695a3d74542ff8cb0e5011a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16cc132e1dd806eedf8b6d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf10f617dcaefa2ac3be2573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一场比赛观战……和往常一样……\n早上在最近车站的检票口前会合……\n这样可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40ffbe8add52fec887d635cab17e67005d555ddf0a1fa1a9ab4a565656842c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbaaba162d208717e78a9b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人物拍摄也……再多学学吧……\n以后再一起……出远门什么的……\n应该还有这样的机会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18f827049df7828bcda262f2372453bffd19525a14947619a277a6cca06af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19101c03dd1efbfb0779947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年参拜……祈愿的话果然还是……\n『全阵营平安』……吧！\n平安无事才能创造精彩的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3e3c03d4992d9bfe546f7e8bede1c3129eb0bc44db5b40f048babfe44288135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20650c3283e005d4f1f2a45d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力的准备，每年都万无一失。\n多亏了『情人节锦标赛』，\n一到这个时期我就会想起来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02483913a4f8e2e880296405358fc75d95120529e40c6cd868925270c659a221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:521a49283c552b2a239af014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "试着按闸门颜色做了八种口味的\n巧克力……不知道有没有\n……能合口味的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0682af2dd077e5d261e23080316a5133a2c89aac7588bb4e732035deebb700d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781d68ea5fe22390432308fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着广场上的祈福签……\n不同阵营的『梦想』在此交织……\n真好啊……真是浪漫呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a1b2edaaff5de998459c926a0cba431f249ddb995bffe7b98d496b8ec4e06a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9928c5793677e1806fde0297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "埋头读着史料时……不知为何\n头上多了顶丁髻假发……回过神来\n才发现被万圣节恶作剧了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58e5a784f22ae6782adf62c76c0ad9e39125e4b3574112f67ea2a3e43f6b89f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c553d45fd167a73cb1b1e6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我家，说到圣诞就是珍珠鸡……\n爸爸每年都会大显身手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8753e4bd24c346454206a9981ba3cd5b1b1929b9292a6f524f09fa9d84da610c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d0870fc1de44b59e97fa6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的话，赛场上的灯光……\n非常漂亮……那个，今晚……\n要一起……去看看吗……?",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5831998f283786a80dc0011941a0c2b234aecfe955413b5cb8312c91996cf45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948dff028e5c3f509ed69770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和预想的一样…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de30aab60cab8a80dfeaace62e28edf84a29f5a37dde3adc2ed7961b968d7ccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d92c7706dfedd468789979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前不久还是二月锦标……\n现在又到有马纪念了……\n时间过得真快啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb6ae07412974dc055c231245e1d147ec00b654d968d94ae50e22daad8ed2dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baaaece3f64b1fc3557bb5be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\n训练员的历史\n又添上了新的一页呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "836791fb4bbe88c6500fc9cd1795a939da2549a7ebb2f644299393888339f66b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:277c97d2081ce8f5f0b18cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我选了帽子作为礼物……\n毕竟，你总是愿意顶着烈日\n陪我去赛场呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "419e2913dc7ca65187d43ccb4fbf9361082e9b8a6dd4241c83d8dc8bcb476f2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b49fd1d5fb4e2de2cdab65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船发来一个叫\n『联合炒面派对邀请函』的东西……\n是要办生日会吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae90a18bd3913b0bcb61c5b5f844a2cd21afcc8dc213ac5baa9080466d2bebb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772a6d6edb20a7913464987b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为生日纪念，能和我一起\n拍张照片吗？这将会成为\n我们共同写下新历史的证明……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f81c4975b483883d01c57933500350e441083618787d8db2a9a38d6fa9745199",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af750da361ae67357ea15db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知呢。\n可能和赛场状况或者\n开跑时间有关……我们去看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "978a1702ba7d4901389d7fa5a493b176a807cd493ded88dae343681ef469535c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42717c7e50dfb24aba785526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物送到了。\n难道是URA发来的奖品……\n看来不是呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0633c808e917c66d66c418f4170c4e78db0021012532cb8ad3514be03663dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977b18777087ed96501b953d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务辛苦了。\n作为成就记录……\n还请收下这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00386d86105df2e187af40ed52914e2bd54f2ead3c72a6a5fddb3be39db6551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dabbd7b5be44a37545e551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动。\n会上演什么样的历史戏剧呢……!",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1ad4561b65516e9ff97491c0c1782b3bcb9f1965ba8614882bf90b9f5d3b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a97823dde990021fce6eb7b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动呢……\n为了记录决定性的瞬间，\n相机已经准备好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1839d3353e1cde221f11cadd3a7829fe0a0eabc8b950573566c2979c90c0519e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a5c45098cf0abe3336c35f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea388628d91740324add460da4117a9c14e91958f600421d58676a45c67854c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73505bbd40b2a02785f9abab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像上升了。\n呵呵，史料又增加了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9013d68c44d0100ebab4ee7f3f3c8bf9d9d80f513ea981b44439e715a8dcf12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cba892c4a3835046f65be9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跨越了诸多历史的，\n那个京都赛场的终点板钥匙圈\n……呵呵，买到好东西了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5c547569516994a70ecc0ca8c7603eaccb75b2347a134c973a489197bb0662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa0ff347f56ad90c920b023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被赛场拉面店的老板记住了……\n最近会在点餐前就对我说\n『老样子吧！』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf5ea889435bdff7abdc59be616ea3cbce5da70e18e20620d2b4f00636c54c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a448f328ffdc39deb3db8c31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发上的缎带是爷爷送的……\n据说是舶来品……\n呵呵，我在出门时都会带着它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d675e2cc35ecca225426e9fa3ebe3eeddeb2d029db89c6587f0a3c4ea7d46982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d94f761aeab0bbfe816271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直就是大决战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b455ac7c1f433d78b7fef520d1740f01a46cb587e2360597bed033e1de3b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7ae52890e7b5138bdaa5ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精彩的对决……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8e4d39a84986e47a6b8fa10ed8828b4418647002e2e66f36ff2c5454be72f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfbca0a3080ac8a8a7817c32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea388628d91740324add460da4117a9c14e91958f600421d58676a45c67854c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:294b48ba91fb98421a64d134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直就是大决战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b455ac7c1f433d78b7fef520d1740f01a46cb587e2360597bed033e1de3b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e93b352126c645547321168",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是历代第一呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05d3345c7a217dfeeeeed96c84d34d92df123d5d4492e648eb201b98b17e87f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c707373b8f933d4408ac56d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要把这一战，载入历史…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "298ea7fcca7001f3557c17447854d2700625b1ea179e327daae99a269e56bdc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd381662fc6cb7df29131c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4079d8a32df7f99d4c9af808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伟大的历史也是从训练开始的……\n一起好好努力吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eef5a4a6813da62a3e6c355bbf168cc6d5487215f6ea2a6d41de5762afe631f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d06518f2456900d8cdc19baa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也就是说……这样的话……\n在学园史上也是——啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ea54666c008e33a397f2d4c7ac58f2004739888f391888c30e0f49e88392c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c772a5a9075be64b1f090b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛报名……\n要去刻下新的足迹呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "456629db69c44078a37b00eccb9f225cd57078238ed97197ce4a8697ec842be1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad68dacfb6ec0f1c7b9f327",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5edfe411e2a0ee6f0109809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以伟大的历史为食粮……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "824305a4d752f7697242c8425a968eece953ce8d7a387bc93d7988593eb04cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5560a87dba9a0d3c4f25c0e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "L、Love you♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "b89ab981a872ba541ffe3a3b365b0a49fdb31aace1602a3010a8e516fbfba5e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b5969236b79ab274c2d77c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓赛跑史！",
      "source_fingerprint": "823b0c457ee0250f22bd910de9c9ecf2e9bf6617466e22424f179ea3be8e6e1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c315afa4f9be3168efb905b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的本命是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e264ed1065162c8720740fda6eb690c090d010aa145f031cc9fd055f0cee9be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76a7949d48849c47cc3a1aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登陆奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c451efdc0ebe871868792a3a0053f4f6d8a744cf04d610b8efd3347ae6c4856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75ee7ca46ce006a072c1df9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请加油……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa44b20d46a90058f792a36e1895d18affc8b4fe096ac1d7a79088d311a4d71a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
